      "sourceTextSha256": "b0a515e1f402eb683e36f8e99bb26e261ea6f29d6f3f72d9c22e354f542e2881",
      "text": "Breakfast and a full day on Lake Titicaca. The first stop is the floating reed islands of the Uros, whose friendly inhabitants show you how they build their reed boats and islands. Then a motorboat takes you to Taquile Island, where the islanders still keep their ancestral traditions and colourful clothing; explore the island and enjoy the best views of the lake. Typical lunch at a community restaurant, and return to Puno near sunset.",
